# TermLoom Showcase Script
Output assets/termloom_demo.svg

Set FontSize 15
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set Width 86
Set Height 20
Set Theme catppuccin-mocha
Set WindowStyle macos

Type "termloom --version"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "git status --short"
Enter
Sleep 1200ms
Type "echo 'TermLoom: Vector Terminal Session Recorder'"
Enter
Sleep 2s
